  "caption": {
    "text": "Part 3 of REDIS EXPIRY & EVICTION. Your Redis key did not disappear at its deadline — it just became invisible. This handbook walks the whole death pipeline: the TTL command surface and the flags that quietly clear it, the lazy and active expiry cycles that actually reclaim memory, and how maxmemory turns 'soon' into a hard budget under approximated LRU and LFU. Ten pages of internals, sampling math, and the six mistakes that cause silent data loss or an OOM at 3am.",
